  "content_id": "16136209",
  "title": "Celo Network Fees",
  "description": "Celo (CELO) Network – Fast Mobile-Friendly Blockchain\nCelo focuses on bringing blockchain to mobile users with extremely low fees and fast...",
  "body": "<h1 id=\"h_01JSZ64SYVYP75WF2QWHH81D0Y\">Celo (CELO) Network – Fast Mobile-Friendly Blockchain</h1><p class=\"no-margin\">Celo focuses on bringing blockchain to mobile users with extremely low fees and fast transactions.</p><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ64SYVCCTZEQG27YJRATP6\">How CELO Fees Work</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Gas fees (gwei x gas limit)</b> paid in <b>CELO</b> tokens.</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Like Ethereum, but much cheaper and optimized for fast confirmations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\">Edge Wallet auto-calculates the best gas price based on current Celo network conditions.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ64SYV0E9MNRWS3E0A4JWH\">Fee Options Available</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>High</b> – Fastest confirmation</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Optimal (default)</b> – Balanced</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Low</b> – Cheapest option</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Custom</b> – Full manual setting available</p></li></ul><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ64SYV7HM0KDC0H2MXAWA3\">Average Cost</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Usually <b>$0.001 to $0.005 USD</b> per transaction.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ64SYVZ9J5ZM985Z2J4YGT\">Why It Matters</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Celo brings blockchain to smartphones at incredible speeds and costs. Edge handles fee optimization automatically so you get the best price without lifting a finger.</p><hr>",
